== 8d locked child inside a group: parent-group transform refused, then unlock & repeat
   group X edit: bounds "{\"x\":70,\"y\":338,\"w\":76,\"h\":10}" -> "{\"x\":70,\"y\":338,\"w\":76,\"h\":10}" toast: "“Dot” is locked; transforming its parent group would move it. Unlock it in Layers first."
